---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import SiteHeader from '../components/SiteHeader.astro';
import SiteFooter from '../components/SiteFooter.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="Arête Fellowship | EA Durham"
	description="The Arête Fellowship is an eight-week seminar programme aimed to help you think about how you can have a positive impact on the world."
>
	<SiteHeader />

	<main
		class="relative min-h-screen bg-cover bg-center bg-fixed bg-no-repeat"
		style="background-image: url('/assets/shared/page-hero-bg.jpg');"
	>
		<!-- Semi-transparent cream overlay to align with the EA brand theme and ensure readability -->
		<div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#f4efe9]/85 backdrop-blur-[2px]"></div>

		<!-- Content container -->
		<div class="relative z-10 mx-auto w-full max-w-[980px] px-5 py-16 md:py-24">
			<!-- Page Title -->
			<div class="text-center mb-12">
				<h1
					class="font-ea-heading text-4xl md:text-5xl font-normal tracking-[0.25em] text-[#054d5a] uppercase mb-4"
				>
					Arête Fellowship
				</h1>
				<div class="mx-auto h-[3px] w-24 bg-[#0c869b]"></div>
			</div>

			<!-- Main Content Card -->
			<div
				class="bg-white/95 border border-[#e8dfd3] rounded-lg shadow-md p-8 md:p-12 transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-lg"
			>
				<!-- Closed Term Alert Banner -->
				<div
					class="bg-[#fcf8e3] border border-[#fbeed5] text-[#c09853] rounded-[5px] p-5 mb-8 text-center text-base font-ea-body"
				>
					<strong>Applications have closed for Epiphany Term 2025.</strong> Join
					our <a
						href="https://outlook.office365.com/owa/effectivealtruismdurham@durhamuniversity.onmicrosoft.com/groupsubscription.ashx?action=join&source=MSExchange/LokiServer&guid=d19d28fc-165b-4f90-ae3c-7cc8ec3697c6"
						target="_blank"
						rel="noreferrer noopener"
						class="underline hover:text-[#a47e3c] font-bold">mailing list</a
					> or <a
						href="https://www.instagram.com/effectivealtruismdurham/"
						target="_blank"
						rel="noreferrer noopener"
						class="underline hover:text-[#a47e3c] font-bold"
						>follow us on Instagram</a
					> to find out more about our programmes.
				</div>

				<!-- Text Block -->
				<div
					class="prose max-w-none text-[#404040] font-ea-body text-[16px] md:text-[18px] leading-[1.8] space-y-6 mb-12"
				>
					<p>
						The Arête Fellowship is an 8-week seminar programme aimed to help
						you think about how you can have a positive impact on the world.
						Each week, fellows will read, think about and discuss key ideas and
						concepts from a range of disciplines related to doing good
						effectively. We expect it to take a total of 3-3.5 hours each week
						(~2 hours of reading/exercises each week and 1 hour 30 mins in a
						discussion group).
					</p>
					<p>
						This syllabus is based on a similar programme at University of <a
							href="https://eaoxford.com/"
							target="_blank"
							rel="noreferrer noopener"
							class="text-[#0c869b] hover:text-[#054d5a] underline font-semibold"
							>Oxford</a
						>; it is also hosted by other universities throughout the world,
						including <a
							href="https://www.eacambridge.org/"
							target="_blank"
							rel="noreferrer noopener"
							class="text-[#0c869b] hover:text-[#054d5a] underline font-semibold"
							>Cambridge</a
						>, <a
							href="https://www.harvardea.org/"
							target="_blank"
							rel="noreferrer noopener"
							class="text-[#0c869b] hover:text-[#054d5a] underline font-semibold"
							>Harvard</a
						>, <a
							href="https://web.stanford.edu/group/ea/"
							target="_blank"
							rel="noreferrer noopener"
							class="text-[#0c869b] hover:text-[#054d5a] underline font-semibold"
							>Stanford</a
						>, <a
							href="https://www.yaleea.com/"
							target="_blank"
							rel="noreferrer noopener"
							class="text-[#0c869b] hover:text-[#054d5a] underline font-semibold"
							>Yale</a
						>, and others. It has been lightly edited by the exec at EA Durham
						so that it fits easier into the typical Durham term.
					</p>
					<p>
						Topics covered will include: research into effectiveness and impact,
						effective charities, animals and moral consideration, the moral
						status of future generations, emerging technologies, existential
						risk and high-impact careers. Readings are ordered by importance so
						please do not worry if you are occasionally unable to complete
						everything.
					</p>
				</div>

				<!-- Section Accent Divider -->
				<hr class="border-t border-[#e8dfd3] my-8" />

				<!-- Action Buttons -->
				<div
					class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-5"
				>
					<!-- Syllabus Link -->
					<a
						href="https://docs.google.com/document/d/18vAoZb2Uoln-s3iIV0-4naKzo5cCwDTAki3UH0nZw20"
						target="_blank"
						rel="noreferrer noopener"
						class="group inline-flex h-[54px] w-full sm:w-[268px] items-center justify-center gap-3 rounded-[5px] text-[16px] font-bold text-white transition-all duration-300 hover:scale-[1.02]"
						style="background-color: #68246d;"
						onmouseover="this.style.backgroundColor='#541d58'"
						onmouseout="this.style.backgroundColor='#68246d'"
					>
						<span>View Syllabus</span>
						<svg
							viewBox="0 0 24 24"
							class="h-5 w-5 fill-none stroke-current stroke-2"
							aria-hidden="true"
						>
							<path
								stroke-linecap="round"
								stroke-linejoin="round"
								d="M13.5 6H5.25A2.25 2.25 0 003 8.25v10.5A2.25 2.25 0 005.25 21h10.5A2.25 2.25 0 0018 18.75V10.5m-10.5 6L21 3m0 0h-5.25M21 3v5.25"
							></path>
						</svg>
					</a>

					<!-- Back Button -->
					<a
						href="/programmes"
						class="group inline-flex h-[54px] w-full sm:w-[268px] items-center justify-center gap-3 rounded-[5px] text-[16px] font-bold text-[#0c869b] bg-transparent border-2 border-[#0c869b] hover:bg-[#0c869b]/10 transition-all duration-300 hover:scale-[1.02]"
					>
						<svg
							viewBox="0 0 24 24"
							class="h-5 w-5 fill-none stroke-current stroke-2"
							aria-hidden="true"
						>
							<path
								stroke-linecap="round"
								stroke-linejoin="round"
								d="M10.5 19.5L3 12m0 0l7.5-7.5M3 12h18"></path>
						</svg>
						<span>Back to Programmes</span>
					</a>
				</div>
			</div>

			<!-- Testimonials Section -->
			<div class="mt-12">
				<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
					<div
						class="overflow-hidden rounded-[8px] transition-all duration-300 hover:scale-[1.03] hover:shadow-lg bg-white/5"
					>
						<img
							src="/assets/arete-fellowship/1-adriana-testimonial.png"
							alt="Testimonial from Adriana: This fellowship helped me meet like-minded people, while also changing my view on a lot of important topics. I was happy to find a judgement-free zone to bounce off ideas about ethical dilemmas that I had, but maybe didn't know how to voice in a structured way."
							class="w-full h-auto object-cover rounded-[8px]"
							loading="lazy"
						/>
					</div>
					<div
						class="overflow-hidden rounded-[8px] transition-all duration-300 hover:scale-[1.03] hover:shadow-lg bg-white/5"
					>
						<img
							src="/assets/arete-fellowship/2-tia-testimonial.png"
							alt="Testimonial from Tia: The Arete fellowship improved my confidence to speak and express my ideas whilst teaching me about a philosophy I still support in my every day life."
							class="w-full h-auto object-cover rounded-[8px]"
							loading="lazy"
						/>
					</div>
					<div
						class="overflow-hidden rounded-[8px] transition-all duration-300 hover:scale-[1.03] hover:shadow-lg bg-white/5"
					>
						<img
							src="/assets/arete-fellowship/3-lily-testimonial.png"
							alt="Testimonial from Lily: The fellowship was highly rewarding both due to the inspiring content, and to how brilliantly it was put together by a team who are clearly passionate about what they do, and are keen to share it with others."
							class="w-full h-auto object-cover rounded-[8px]"
							loading="lazy"
						/>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</main>

	<SiteFooter />
</Layout>
